    # Also, after the main loop, we need to process any remaining assignments up to 'until'
    # Wait, the above loop stops when the heap is exhausted, but we might have assignments due after the last processed time but before 'until'
    # Wait, in the code above, when popping from the heap, we check if current_time > until and skip. So the loop continues until the heap is empty, but the 'until' is respected.

    return traces

